- op: discuss  # 0dd7
  at: '2026-05-12T08:33:56Z'  # 0dd7
  by: agent  # 0dd7
  actor: jgstern_agent  # 0dd7
  clock: 3  # 0dd7
  nonce: 0dd7  # 0dd7
  message: "Fixed in PR #3656. Root cause: FileIndex.match_pattern in discovery.py classified '*.blade.php' as pure-extension fast-path; lookup keys on Path.suffix.lower() which retains only the last segment ('.php' for 'foo.blade.php'), so _by_ext['.blade.php'] was always empty. Profile detector then saw 0 .blade.php files and dropped 'blade' from detected languages. Fix: tightened pure-extension branch to also require no '.' in pattern[2:], so compound suffixes (*.blade.php, *.d.ts, *.lagda.md) fall through to the general fnmatch branch. +3 tests (FileIndex compound-suffix blade/d_ts + profile-level blade detection)."  # 0dd7
